our own base\n- Survive against waves of monsters\n- Use strategy, teamwork, and quick reactions\n- Try different difficulties and survival plans", "short_description": "Weavs is a VR game packed with chaotic minigames and a build and survive horror mode where you and your friends create a base, fight off monsters, and try to survive the night."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mostsanestudios.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Most Sane Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mostsanestudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "27498983026409776"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593790560_1765446514890901_9117201444357012327_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eCxGVx_hP2AQ7kNvwE0F_Wo&_nc_oc=AdrmtgrWkxl3xIdZ6HDjgfHrcyEEkcjYkxS81tkjQxApeIOvpEaecsABhCQiSKgCkyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZ7PiLYWfA4dFXTD31sIELwmLylUwZ1grmjSwMJ1QclQ&oe=6AFB1C55"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Weavs", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id":